<title>USA: Visx sees Q2 below expectations.</title>
<headline>Visx sees Q2 below expectations.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA CLARA, Calif. 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>VISX Inc said Thursday revenue and net income levels are expected to to fall below the company's expectations for the second quarter and fiscal year 1997 because of weaker than anticipated demand for its excimer laser system in the U.S.</p>
<p>The company said it expects unit shipments of laser systems in the U.S. for the remaining three quarters of the year to be in line with those of the first quarter of 1997.</p>
</text>
